{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51498","headline":"阙下献杨侍郎 · 李郢","name":"阙下献杨侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沧洲垂钓本无名，十月风霜偶到京。\n羸马未曾谙道路，片文谁爲达公卿？\n听残晓漏愁终在，画尽寒灰计不成。\n心苦篇章头早白，十年江汉忆先生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}